    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Captain Odo Pritchard of the Gradsul City Watch.</strong> Fifty. CR 4.</p><p>A competent, tired officer with three daughters at the convent school and two guilds on his books: the Gull pays him for early warning, the Weigher for late arrival, and he does an honest job of everything else. He stops the fights he can see and arrests what he can prove.</p><p><strong>What he will do for the Gull:</strong> lose one prisoner, once, if she asks \u2014 and in the Gull's Job that favour costs her the party's papers. <strong>What he will not do for anybody:</strong> touch a killing. Subdue is the reason for this sheet; the Watch takes prisoners.</p><p><em>Sheet derived from the Marshal Rennic Thale stat block (CR 4, 65 hp) \u2014 kit renamed.</em></p>",
        "public": ""
      },
